","text":"②国家工作人员和军人一律追究","bbox":[646.2,474.746,211.533,15.109],"nodeIds":["law-p015-n0039"]},{"id":"law-p015-b0020","text":"保护管辖","bbox":[549.877,561.625,60.438,15.109],"nodeIds":["law-p015-n0040"]},{"id":"law-p015-b0021","text":"外国人在中华人民共和国领域外对中国公民或者国家犯罪","bbox":[646.2,518.186,377.737,15.109],"nodeIds":["law-p015-n0041","law-p015-n0042","law-p015-n0043"]},{"id":"law-p015-b0022","text":"①最低刑为3年以上有期徒刑","bbox":[646.2,555.969,197.825,20.765],"nodeIds":["law-p015-n0044","law-p015-n0045","law-p015-n0046","law-p015-n0047"]},{"id":"law-p015-b0023","text":"②犯罪地的法律认为应予以处罚","bbox":[646.2,605.065,211.532,15.109],"nodeIds":["law-p015-n0048","law-p015-n0049","law-p015-n0050","law-p015-n0051"]},{"id":"law-p015-b0024","text":"普遍管辖","bbox":[549.877,670.225,60.438,15.109],"nodeIds":["law-p015-n0052"]},{"id":"law-p015-b0025","text":"对于我国缔结或者参加的国际条约所规定的罪行","bbox":[646.2,648.505,317.299,15.109],"nodeIds":["law-p015-n0053"]},{"id":"law-p015-b0026","text":"我国在所承担条约义务的范围内行使刑事管辖权","bbox":[646.2,691.945,317.299,15.109],"nodeIds":["law-p015-n0054"]},{"id":"law-p015-b0027","text":"时间效力","bbox":[453.554,757.104,60.438,15.109],"nodeIds":["law-p015-n0055"]},{"id":"law-p015-b0028","text":"生效时间：1997年10月1日","bbox":[549.877,729.802,190.594,20.691],"nodeIds":["law-p015-n0056","law-p015-n0057","law-p015-n0058","law-p015-n0059","law-p015-n0060","law-p015-n0061","law-p015-n0062"]},{"id":"law-p015-b0029","text":"溯及力：从旧兼从轻原则","bbox":[549.877,778.824,166.204,15.109],"nodeIds":["law-p015-n0063","law-p015-n0064","law-p015-n0065"]},{"id":"law-p015-b0030","text":"15","bbox":[587.275,810.711,16.0,21.344],"nodeIds":["law-p015-n0066"]}],"questions":[{"id":"law-p015-q001","number":1,"type":"fill-in","answer":"罪刑法定原则","bbox":[453.554,59.235,90.657,15.109],"fontSize":15.109,"color":"#8e24aa","segments":[{"text":"罪刑法定原则","bbox":[453.554,59.235,90.657,15.109],"color":"#8e24aa"}],"nodeIds":["law-p015-n0004"],"aliases":[],"context":"____"},{"id":"law-p015-q002","number":2,"type":"fill-in","answer":"刑法面前人","bbox":[453.5